<title>UK: M&amp;G names Morse head of UK equities.</title>
<headline>M&amp;G names Morse head of UK equities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>M&amp;G Group plc said on Monday it had appointed Sam Morse head of UK equities.</p>
<p>Morse was head of income funds at Fidelity and succeeds Richard Hughes, who becomes vice chairman of M&amp;G Investment Management.</p>
<p>Morse will join M&amp;G in October.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887.</p>
